{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/61","id":4453427962,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSvcS2c8AAAABCXHq-g","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/61","diff_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/61.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/61.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/issues/61","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/61/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/61/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/issues/61/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/statuses/ac5aecc7a0dcb66aa1eb6c3ef7033ba15b74656a","number":61,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix Darwin upgrade host guard for verified existing installation","user":{"login":"pashamango","id":141678664,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHHYSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141678664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"PR #60's exact `ComputerName == Darwin` check rejects the actual `Darwin-on-MacBookPro3` before mutation. This three-file hotfix admits that observed host only with an existing account-owned Darwin mailbox installation; no Mac rename is required.\n\nThe guard now checks macOS/non-root, ownership of the installation/control files/policy/plist, compiled agent/host/repository policy, valid manifest/activation, expected LaunchAgent label and installation-local absolute runtime path. Existing installed-byte and exact runtime-pointer checks still precede installation mutation. ComputerName/LocalHostName are an additional exact-pair compatibility check: observed `Darwin-on-MacBookPro3`/`Darwin-on-MacBookPro3`, or legacy `Darwin`/`Darwin`. No prefix or case-folded matching. HostName can remain unset; Tailscale DNS is diagnostic context, not a new dependency.\n\nThe original installation has no hardware-bound identity. A complete same-user clone with matching/rewritten absolute paths and exact names is indistinguishable; this residual limitation is documented rather than claiming physical-device authentication. Incomplete copies, stale copied paths, wrong owners/policy/label/bytes and unrelated hosts are rejected.\n\nAll PR #60 capability, claims/receipts/history, activation watermark, permanent #55/#56/#57/#58 exclusions, rollback and fail-closed behavior remain intact. No capability/consumer/Wolfram code changed. No live Darwin changes, CEOffice deployment, cleanup, task replay or merge was performed.\n\n## Validation\n\nTested head: `ac5aecc7a0dcb66aa1eb6c3ef7033ba15b74656a`.\n\n`PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v`: **117 tests PASS in 19.415 seconds**, including the full previous 108-test suite and nine identity regressions. `git diff --check` passes; clean working tree. New tests cover observed/legacy identities, unrelated macOS and prefix lookalikes, mixed names, Linux, root, copied absolute runtime paths, incomplete state, wrong label/ownership, invalid activation and installed-byte drift. These are local fixtures, not live Darwin upgrade evidence.\n\n## Exact replacement upgrade command\n\nManually merge this PR using **Create a merge commit**, preserving tested-head ancestry. Do not auto-merge. The compiled expected branch is now `agent/wolfram/DARWIN-MAILBOX-0002-HOTFIX-01`. Actual PR/repository/head/base/merged state and both head/merge ancestry in canonical main remain mandatory before mutation.\n\nAfter review and manual merge, run this **one exact command locally on Darwin**:\n\n```sh\n(umask 077; upgrade_checkout=\"$(mktemp -d \"$HOME/ChitAkasha-Darwin/mailbox-upgrade-0002-hotfix.XXXXXX\")\" && git clone --quiet --no-checkout https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab.git \"$upgrade_checkout\" && git -C \"$upgrade_checkout\" checkout --quiet --detach ac5aecc7a0dcb66aa1eb6c3ef7033ba15b74656a && python3 \"$upgrade_checkout/tools/darwin-mailbox-upgrade\" upgrade --pr 61 --expected-head ac5aecc7a0dcb66aa1eb6c3ef7033ba15b74656a)\n```\n\nLive read-only `checked()` verification against open PR #61 rejects it as unmerged; no installer was invoked.\n\nThe command stages the full verified capability upgrade, preserves the existing watermark and all history, and runs the same harmless installed offline smoke. Rollback and smoke procedures from the capability runbook are unchanged.\n\n## Failed #60 attempt: cleanup\n\nGiven the reported `ComputerName must be Darwin` error and the exact #60 command, the wrapper already created a detached temporary checkout at `~/ChitAkasha-Darwin/mailbox-upgrade-0002.*`, possibly with Python bytecode caches. The failure occurred before locks, staging, disable gate, journal or LaunchAgent mutation. **No mailbox-state cleanup or rollback is needed.** The disposable checkout may be retained; cleanup is optional and must target only the identified checkout. Nothing was deleted. This conclusion is based on reported error/code ordering, not remote inspection of Darwin.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-05T23:00:16Z","updated_at":"2026-09-05T23:03:10Z","closed_at":"2026-09-05T23:03:10Z","merged_at":"2026-09-05T23:03:10Z","merge_commit_sha":"59a5590b52ca55e7741ee45e5a615c16ca90c543","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"pashamango:agent/wolfram/DARWIN-MAILBOX-0002-HOTFIX-01","ref":"agent/wolfram/DARWIN-MAILBOX-0002-HOTFIX-01","repo":{"id":1257706201,"node_id":"R_kgDOSvcS2Q","name":"minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab","full_name":"pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab","owner":{"login":"pashamango","id":141678664,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHHYSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141678664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":true,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Private lab for Minutta RP/PR cycle rehearsal","homepage":null,"language":"Python","visibility":"private","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":486,"open_issues":486,"size":3309